# .npmrc
# Routes @tek scoped packages to GitHub Packages registry.
# Replace YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME with your GitHub username or org name.
#
# Each developer needs to add their auth token to ~/.npmrc:
#   //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=YOUR_GITHUB_TOKEN
#
# Generate a token at: github.com/settings/tokens
# Required scopes: read:packages (to install), write:packages (to publish)

@tek:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
